/// {@end-tool}
/// {@endtemplate}␀À¡6…’À¦¶…0/// {@template flutter.material.inputDecoration.floatingLabelStyle}
/// The style to use for [InputDecoration.labelText] when the label is
/// above (i.e., vertically adjacent to) the input field.
